  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">The function \(C\) gives the temperature, in degrees Fahrenheit, of a pot of coffee \(x\) minutes after it is made. </para>
<para>What does the statement \(C(10)&lt;C(5)\) mean in the context of the problem?<c context="" in="" mean="" of="" p="" problem="" the=""/>
</para></section>
</content>
